{"id":"seguro","lemma":"seguro","pos":"adj","rank":137,"glosses":["secure; safe (free from danger)","certain; sure; positive; definite (of being correct)","secure; firm; stable; reliable; surefire; foolproof (not likely to fall)"],"ipa":"/seˈɡuɾo/","forms":{"feminine":"segura","masculinePlural":"seguros","femininePlural":"seguras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-seguro.wav","formAudio":{"segura":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-B25es-Segura.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Cómo puede usted estar tan seguro?","en":"How can you be so sure?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461845","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"so, as"},null]},{"text":"¿Están ustedes seguros de que quieren hacerlo?","en":"Are you sure you want to do that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687631","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"you all"},null,null,null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that"]]},{"text":"¿Estoy segura aquí?","en":"Am I safe here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65253","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Me siento seguro.","en":"I feel safe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819917","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},null]},{"text":"Aquí no me siento segura.","en":"I don't feel safe here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221458","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},null]}]}